      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requisites: \n    S3 Bucket Remote State Backend\n        Bucket Versioning\n        Server-Side Encryption\n        Use restrictive IAM Rules\n        Lockfile\n        https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/backend/s3\n    Environment separation via directories\n        use shared modules to reduce duplicate code\n\nStage 1:\n    validates code on every pull request\n    init, validate, fmt --check and a security scan\nStage 2:\n    after Stage 1 succeeds\n    init in staging\n    generate tfplan\n    post plan with github-script to pr\nStage 3:\n    once pr is approved apply it to staging\n    init, plan -out=tfplan, apply tfplan\nStage 4:\n    2 Gates, git version tag & manual approval step via environments\n    init in production, plan -out=prod.tfplan\n    upload prod.tfplan to Github Actions Artifacts\n    apply job with plan artifact download and apply",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requisites: \n    S3 Bucket Remote State Backend\n        Bucket Versioning\n        Server-Side Encryption\n        Use restrictive IAM Rules\n        Lockfile\n        https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/backend/s3\n    Environment separation via directories\n        use shared modules to reduce duplicate code\n\nStage 1:\n    validates code on every pull request\n    init, validate, fmt --check and a security scan\nStage 2:\n    after Stage 1 succeeds\n    init in staging\n    generate tfplan\n    post plan with github-script to pr\nStage 3:\n    once pr is approved apply it to staging\n    init, plan -out=tfplan, apply tfplan\nStage 4:\n    2 Gates, git version tag & manual approval step via environments\n    init in production, plan -out=prod.tfplan\n    upload prod.tfplan to Github Actions Artifacts\n    apply job with plan artifact download and apply",
